msgid "Support for `stretch` in Quantum Compute is currently experimental and has the following constraints:\n"
msgstr "Підтримка `stretch` у Qiskit Runtime наразі є експериментальною і має такі обмеження:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- At most one stretch variable per _qubit set_ between barriers (implicit and explicit). A qubit set is one or more qubits; these sets must be mutually exclusive.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Не більше однієї змінної stretch на _набір кубітів_ між бар'єрами (неявними та явними). Набір кубітів — це один або кілька кубітів; ці набори мають бути взаємовиключними.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Неправильно\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q0)  # Invalid because 2 stretches are applied on q0\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q0)  # Invalid because 2 stretches are applied on q0\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Правильно\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q2)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q2)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- The area surrounded by a set of barriers is called a _barrier region_. A stretch variable cannot be used in multiple barrier regions.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Область, оточена набором бар'єрів, називається _бар'єрним регіоном_. Змінна stretch не може використовуватися в кількох бар'єрних регіонах.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Неправильно\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        # Stretch a is used in two barrier regions\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"         ```\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        # Stretch a is used in two barrier regions\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"         ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        ![Illustration of the previous code output](/docs/images/guides/stretch/bad-barrier-region.svg 'Invalid use of stretch in barrier regions')\n"
msgstr "        ![Illustration of the previous code output](/docs/images/guides/stretch/bad-barrier-region.svg 'Invalid use of stretch in barrier regions')\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
